title WF03 Submission and peer review - activity
|Author (project member)|
start
:Create submission with manuscript or finished report;
|LumiGap platform|
:Store submission and revision;
|Author (project member)|
:Run AI pre-review (optional);
|LumiGap platform|
:Run pre-review in background;
|AI reviewer service (Python)|
:Analyse manuscript against claims\nand related papers;
|LumiGap platform|
:Mark ready for review;
repeat
  |Author (project member)|
  :Request review from a verified lecturer
and pick a template;
  |LumiGap platform|
  :Create request and assignment, notify reviewer;
  |Reviewer (verified lecturer)|
  if (Accept the request?) then (no)
    :Decline;
  else (yes)
  endif
repeat while (Request declined?) is (yes) not (no)
|Reviewer (verified lecturer)|
repeat
  :Complete rubric review and overall assessment;
  :Submit review round;
  |LumiGap platform|
  :Record review, update statuses, notify author;
  |Author (project member)|
  :Read review feedback;
  if (Revision required?) then (yes)
    :Upload revised version and respond to items;
    |Reviewer (verified lecturer)|
    :Verify author responses, accept or reopen;
  else (no)
  endif
repeat while (Revision round open?) is (yes) not (no)
|Author (project member)|
stop
note right
  A request that is not answered
  expires (platform).
end note
@enduml
